# Booking — Agent Rules

**Full spec:** [docs/booking-feature.md](../../docs/booking-feature.md)  
**Global rules:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)

## Before coding

1. Read `docs/booking-feature.md` and `AGENTS.md`
2. Auth required before booking — guests redirect to login with `redirect` param
3. No backend — Zustand + AsyncStorage via `safeStorage`

## Routes

- Detail: `src/app/artisan/[id]/index.tsx`
- Booking form: `src/app/artisan/[id]/book.tsx`

## Store

- `useBookingStore` — persist `ClientBooking[]`
- Filter bookings by `clientId` in UI
- New bookings start as `pending`

## UI

- Reuse `AuthTextInput`, `PrimaryButton`, `AuthScreenLayout`
- Icons in `src/components/icons.tsx` only
- NativeWind + StyleSheet exceptions per AGENTS.md
- Dark mode required

## Done when

- Book Now opens booking form (with auth gate)
- Submit creates persisted booking
- Client Bookings tab lists user's bookings
- Lint passes
